{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":53,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Who has believed our report? And to whom has the arm of Jehovah been revealed?","tok":[{"t":"Who has "},{"t":"believed","s":["H0539"],"a":[1]},{"t":" our "},{"t":"report","s":["H8052"],"a":[2]},{"t":"? And to whom has the "},{"t":"arm","s":["H2220"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" been "},{"t":"revealed","s":["H1540"],"a":[7]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":2,"text":"For He grew up like a tender plant before Him, And like a root out of dry ground. He has no attracting form nor majesty that we should look upon Him, Nor beautiful appearance that we should desire Him.","tok":[{"t":"For He "},{"t":"grew","s":["H5927"],"a":[0]},{"t":" up like a "},{"t":"tender","s":["H3126"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"plant","s":["H3126"],"a":[1]},{"t":" before Him, And like a "},{"t":"root","s":["H8328"],"a":[3]},{"t":" out of "},{"t":"dry","s":["H6723"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"ground","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":". He has no attracting "},{"t":"form","s":["H8389"],"a":[7]},{"t":" nor "},{"t":"majesty","s":["H1926"],"a":[10]},{"t":" that we should "},{"t":"look","s":["H7200"],"a":[11]},{"t":" upon Him, Nor "},{"t":"beautiful","s":["H4758"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"appearance","s":["H4758"],"a":[13]},{"t":" that we should "},{"t":"desire","s":["H2530"],"a":[14]},{"t":" Him."}]},{"n":3,"text":"He was despised and forsaken of men, A man of sorrows and acquainted with grief; And like one from whom men hide their faces, He was despised; and we did not esteem Him.","tok":[{"t":"He was "},{"t":"despised","s":["H0959"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and forsaken of "},{"t":"men","s":["H0376"],"a":[2]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"sorrows","s":["H4341"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and acquainted with "},{"t":"grief","s":["H2483"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; And like one from whom men "},{"t":"hide","s":["H4564"],"a":[7]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"faces","s":["H6440"],"a":[8]},{"t":", He was "},{"t":"despised","s":["H0959"],"a":